{%- comment -%} Note Judge.me (badge pré-rendu par l'app). Sans avis Judge.me, on affiche les étoiles Avis Garantis du produit s'il en a. Param : p {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign jb = p.metafields.judgeme.badge -%}
{%- if jb == blank or jb contains "data-number-of-reviews='0'" or jb contains 'data-number-of-reviews="0"' -%}
<div class="lc4-rating lc4-rating--ag grc-category-stars" data-product-id="{{ p.id }}"></div>
{%- else -%}
<div class="lc4-rating jdgm-widget jdgm-preview-badge" data-id="{{ p.id }}" data-auto-install="false">{{ jb }}</div>
{%- endif -%}
